<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dec c/a deficit widens to $1.89 bln.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dec c/a deficit widens to $1.89 bln.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's current account (C/A) deficit widened to $1.89 billion in December from a $347.4 million deficit a year earlier, preliminary figures from the Bank of Korea (BOK) showed on Sunday.</p>
<p>				 Dec 1996	Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Current account	-1,888.4	-1,946.5	-347.4</p>
<p>    Trade account	    -949.0	-1,262.2	+170.1</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)	  11,716.2	11,510.5    11,580.3</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)	  12,665.2	12,772.7    11,410.2</p>
<p>    Invisible trade	  -859.0	  -629.2	-420.7</p>
<p>Note: figures are in millions of US dollars</p>
</text>
